            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.13.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Byak 13:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Hakaba hariho omushaija Omubenyamiini, orikwetwa Kiishi mwene Abieli, mwijukuru wa Zerori, mwene Bekoraasi ya Afia omwana w'Omubenyamiini, omushaija w'amaani emanzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.10.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 10:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi akaba aine omutabani murungi omutsigazi, orikwetwa Saulo. Omu Baisraeli boona hakaba hatarimu orikumuhita; akaba naakira abantu boona aha mutwe, nibamugarukira aha ibega.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eizooba rimwe endogoya za Kiishi, ishe wa Saulo, zikabura, Kiishi nikwo kugira omutabani Saulo ati: Twara omwe aha bairu baitu, mwimukye muze kusherura endogoya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atyo Saulo yaagyenda yaaraba omu nsi y'ebibungo eya Efuraimu, n'omu nsi ya Shalisha; kwonka tibaazibona. Bwanyima baaraba omu nsi ya Shalimu, zaaburayo; baaraba omu nsi y'Ababenyamiini, nayo zaaburayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku baahikire omu nsi ya Zuufi, Saulo yaagira omwiru ou yaabaire aine ati: Ija, tugarukyeyo, taata atakaiha omutima aha ndogoya, akagwemereza ahabwaitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.13.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bag 13:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.3.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 3:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Onu yaamugira ati: Reeba, omuri ruriya rurembo harimu omuntu wa Ruhanga; kandi n'omuntu w'ekitiinisa. Ebi agamba byona, buzima bibakwo. Mbwenu tuzeyo; obundi akaatushobororera eby'oru rugyendo rwaitu oru turimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.6.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bar 6:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.14.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bag 14:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.4.42"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bag 4:42",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Saulo yaabuuza omwiru we ati: Mbwenu shi, ku turaazeyo, ogwo mushaija nitumutwarira ki? Ahakuba entanda zihweire omu nshaho zaitu, kandi titwine mukimbo gw'okutwarira ogwo muntu wa Ruhanga. Mbwenu twine ki? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwiru we yaamugarukamu ati: Reeba, nyine omu ngaro ekicweka kimwe kya kana kya shekeli y'efeeza; nikyo ndaaheereze ogwo muntu wa Ruhanga, akabona kutuhabura omuhanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.25.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kut 25:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.27.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 27:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.24.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 24:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "AMO.7.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Amo 7:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " (Obunyakare omuri Israeli, omuntu ku yaabaire aza kwehanuuza ahari Ruhanga, akaba agira ati: Ija tuze ow'omuhanuuzi; ahabw'okuba orikwetwa nabi omu biro ebi, ira akaba ayetwa omuhanuuzi.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo yaagira omwiru we ati: Ebi waagamba nibyo; ija tugyende. Batyo baataaha omu rurembo omu ogwo muntu wa Ruhanga yaabaire ari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.2.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kur 2:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ku baabaire nibakiinamuka akabungo nibaza omu rurembo, baabugana abaishiki nibaza kutaha amaizi, baababuuza bati: Omuhanuuzi ariyo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.16.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 16:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.3.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bag 3:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Baabagarukamu bati: Ariyo; reeba ari omu maisho gaanyu aho; mwehuute, ahabw'okuba nibwo yaija omu rurembo; kandi eri izooba abantu nibaija kutambira ebitambo omu mwanya mukuru gw'okuramizamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku muraahikye omu rurembo, ahonaaho nimwija kumureeba, atakainamukire kuza kuriira omuri ogwo mwanya mukuru; kandi abantu tibarikubaasa kurya atakaizire, ahakuba niwe ashemereire kushabira ekitambo omugisha; bwanyima abeetsirwe bakabona kurya. Mbwenu mwinamukye; nimwija kumubugana hati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batyo bainamuka nibaza omu rurembo; ku baabaire nibakitaahamu, baabugana Samueli naashohora, naaza omuri ogwo mwanya mukuru gw'okuramizamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
